  "slug": "restaurant-style-coleslaw-i",
  "name": "Restaurant-Style Coleslaw",
  "recipe_type": "salad",
  "brief_description": "This coleslaw recipe makes creamy coleslaw with a sweet-tart taste. The dressing is made with buttermilk, mayonnaise, lemon juice, and vinegar.",
  "cuisine": "American",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Stir mayonnaise, sugar, milk, buttermilk, lemon juice, vinegar, salt, and pepper together in a bowl until smooth."
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "text": "Combine coleslaw mix and onion in a large bowl. Pour mayonnaise mixture over top and stir until well combined. Chill for 1 hour before serving."
    }
  ],
